# The Red Hand's leaders: the boss at the stronghold and the crew bosses.
# Voice: mocking, casual, always counting. Rudi's end is never a joke; the official lie is said flatly.

conv redhand.leader.book
for stronghold:redhand, seat:redhand/crew_boss
topic "Ask about the book."
prio world
voice redhand

node start
  say "The book. Who owes, who's owed, and whose it was before they paid with it."
  say "It has to balance. That's not the same as anyone being paid up. Nobody's ever out of the book. A man who owes nothing walks away."
  > @first "What's the first line?" -> first
  > @mine "What does it say about me?" -> mine
  > @other "Something else." -> hub

node first
  say "Ten litres of diesel, on tick. Next to it, one word: paid."
  say? stronghold :: "My handwriting. Still neat. I was trying back then."
  say "Before my time. Ask the boss. Don't, actually."
  > @rudi "Who was Rudi?" -> rudi
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

node rudi
  say? stronghold :: "He let people pay later. You can't run a road like that."
  say "Rudi was bitten."
  > @back2 "Something else." -> hub

node mine
  say "Show you your own page? That's not how the book works."
  > @look "Show me anyway." -> shown | teased | shut   check persuade redhand 2 harder:paranoid bg:excon,raider
  > @leave1 "Keep it, then." -> hub

node shown
  say "Fine. You've got a page. It's not blank. Here's what it says."
  do call:standing
  > @back3 "Something else." -> hub

node teased
  say "Two lines. One of them's a number. Come back when you're worth a third."
  > @back4 "Something else." -> hub

node shut
  say "The book's for reading out loud, at the right moment. This isn't it."
  > @back5 "Something else." -> hub

conv redhand.leader.toll
for stronghold:redhand, seat:redhand/crew_boss
topic "Ask why the hand is red."
prio flavour
voice redhand

node start
  say "Red hand means stop. Stop means pay. Pay means we're friends. See? Easy."
  say "Bastion paints signs. We paint one sign. Everyone reads ours."
  > @paint "Who painted the first one?" -> paint
  > @other2 "Something else." -> hub

node paint
  say "The boss. On a garage shutter, Day seven. Over some marks that were already there."
  say "Nobody asks about the marks. People who ask get a page."
  > @back6 "Something else." -> hub
